  "_comment": "Retired AI model ids and their replacements, used by the auto-fix for 'model not found / retired' errors and by the first scan of a newly connected repo. Edit this file (or set MODEL_REGISTRY_JSON) without a code change. Replacements are double-checked against the provider's live model list before a fix is pushed whenever that list can be read. Check the provider pages below when you update it.",
